WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.388
Mom: Sit, Lucky.

2
00:00:09.389 --> 00:00:22.901
Sam: We'll be back soon.

3
00:00:22.902 --> 00:00:29.441
Mom: We're here about Reading to the Dogs.

4
00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:34.190
Sam: Lucky likes it when I read to him.

5
00:00:34.191 --> 00:00:38.269
Mom: Can our dog be in your

6
00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:42.475
program? Librarian: The dogs must be calm and

7
00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:48.594
quiet. Is your dog calm and quiet?

8
00:00:48.595 --> 00:01:01.133
Sam: Umm . . . Sam: Lucky is quiet when I read to

9
00:01:01.134 --> 00:01:07.552
him. I can show you!

10
00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:10.740
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

11
00:01:10.741 --> 00:01:23.273
Sam: Lucky, stop! Don't chase the pigeons!

12
00:01:23.274 --> 00:01:25.546
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

13
00:01:25.547 --> 00:01:33.006
Dog on leash: Yap! Yap!

14
00:01:33.007 --> 00:01:48.567
Librarian: Lucky does not seem very quiet.

15
00:01:48.568 --> 00:01:52.026
Sam: Lucky, listen to

16
00:01:52.027 --> 00:02:06.027
this. "A little boy had a big dog . . ."

17
00:02:06.028 --> 00:02:08.969
Sam: See?

18
00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:13.650
Mom: Lucky likes it when Sam reads.

19
00:02:13.651 --> 00:02:24.107
Librarian: Lucky can be in the program!

